        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Storefront Door Deadlatch Keypad Lock Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese complete mortise deadlatch sets with <a href=\"/products/narrow-stile-storefront-door-keypad-entry-lock-kaba-3001\"><b>KABA 3001 mechanical Keypad</b></a>, 1\" mortise cylinder lock, cylinder lock guard and  Push / Pull paddle handle. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nComplete kit for new installations or to convert storefront glass doors from a <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt</b></a>  to a Deadlatch with Push / Pull Paddle Handle.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe KABA Simplex 3001 Heavy Duty fully mechanical Keypad Entry Lock with Passage feature and Key Override for use on narrow stile aluminum and glass doors. Entry Function Lockset - Unlock door with the mechanical pushbutton keypad or with the Key override.  Easy to install, program and maintain.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nKey Override Functions:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Used to gain emergency access from the outside.</li>\r\n<li>Can deactivate and activate the keypad.  Used as a day/night controller, the key can prevent unauthorized entry after hours via the combination keypad.</li>\r\n<li>Can deactivate and activate a deadlatch holdback (Passage feature).  Allows unrestricted access during normal business hours when desired. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Mortise Deadlatch\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handed, Field Reversible</li>\r\n<li>Face plate: 1\" width x 6-7/8\" Length - Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: 7/8\" width x 6\" Lenth, Depth specific to backset (1.63\" - 1.78\").</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" width x 1.0\" length x 1/2\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TH1103.pdf?v=1704262220\" target=\"new\"\"><b>Deadlatch Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p> \r\n<b>Package Includes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/narrow-stile-storefront-door-keypad-entry-lock-kaba-3001\">KABA 3001 Mechanical Keypad</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/drive-assembly-for-kaba-3001\">Drive Assembly for KABA 3001</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-deadlatch-push-pull-handle-th1100-push\">Push / Pull Handle</a></li> \r\n<!-- <li><a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-security-guard\">Cylinder Security Guard</a></li> -->\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\">Mortise Deadlatch Body</a></li> \r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-faceplate-th1100-fp11-15\">Flat Face Plate</a>\r\n</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-single-strike-assembly-th1100-st2\">Strike Plate Assembly</a></li>\r\n<li>Mortise Cylinder Lock: Optional <a href=\"/products/1-inch-brass-mortise-cylinder-lock-for-storefront-door-th1100-bc\">Standard Schlage \"C\" Keyway</a></li> or <a href=\"/products/high-security-store-front-door-1-inch-mortise-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor0c01-26\">Mul-T-Lock High Security Cylinder</a>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWe highly suggest the optional <a href=\"/products/high-security-store-front-door-1-inch-mortise-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor0c01-26\">Mul-T-Lock High Security Cylinder Lock</a> for all applications where restricted keys (Do Not Duplicate) is desired or security is an issue. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>Available in Satin Chrome/Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish for trim.  When ordering more than 1 Set, you can have them Keyed Differently or Keyed Alike (same key for all sets).\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Storefront Door Mortise Deadlatch Keypad Lock Sets, KABA-3001-DLPx",
                "description": "Complete kit for new installations or to convert storefront glass doors from a Motise Deadbolt to a Deadlatch with Push / Pull Paddle Handle. The KABA Simplex 3001 Heavy Duty fully mechanical Keypad Entry Lock with Passage feature and Key Override for use on narrow stile aluminum and glass doors. Entry Function Lockset - Unlock door with the mechanical pushbutton keypad or with the Key override.  Easy to install, program and maintain.",
                "keywords": "KABA-3001-DLPx Storefront Door Deadlatch Keypad Lock Sets, Storefront Door Mortise Deadlatch Keypad Lock Sets, KABA 3001 Storefront Door Keypad Entry Locks, complete Mortise Deadbolt package, Mortise Deadlatch mul-t-lock mortise Lock cylinders, mul-t-lock restricted key mortise cylinders, KABA 3000 series Simplex Keypad Entry Locks, pushbutton keypad locks, store door locks, glass door push button locks, KABA store door push button locks, Narrow Stile Storefront Door Keypad Entry Locks,"
